# Do not commit secrets

When staging or committing in `glif-platform-frontend`, never add:

- `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env.production.local`
- API keys, Railway passwords, OpenRouter keys
- `VITE_*` values that contain secrets

`VITE_API_BASE_URL` belongs in Vercel Environment Variables, not in git. Keep `.env.example` only.
